# Open Loops - .gitignore
#
# Anything that came out of YOUR Slack, Gmail or settings stays on your machine.
# Private files live in exactly two places, so they are easy to find, back up
# or carry to a new machine:
#
#   1. The app's own runtime files, next to app.py (first block below).
#   2. private/ - drop anything else sensitive here: notes, exports, screenshots
#      with real names, sample data. Never committed.
#
# To see every private file git is hiding:
#   git ls-files -o -i --exclude-standard
# To bundle them all into one archive (e.g. before moving machines):
#   git ls-files -o -i --exclude-standard -z | tar -czf ~/openloops-private.tgz --null -T -
#
# The "Generic" blocks are portable - copy them into any other repo as-is.

# ---- Open Loops runtime data (personal, written by the app) -----------------
# your settings: name, Slack ID, internal domains, people, tone
config.json
# your loops
state.json
# learned per-person writing styles
voice.json
# output of the people scan
people_suggested.json
# state/google_oauth.json (Gmail refresh token) and state/logs/ (one log per run)
state/
# Google OAuth client downloaded from Cloud Console
google_oauth_client.json
profiles/
# exports
open-loops-*.md

# ---- Catch-all for anything else private ------------------------------------
private/

# ---- Generic: secrets and credentials ---------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*credentials*.json
*token*.json
*secrets*.json
*.secret
.netrc

# ---- Generic: per-machine tool state ----------------------------------------
# Claude Code local permissions (a shared .claude/ config, if added, stays tracked)
.claude/settings.local.json
# Grok CLI auth, should it ever be written here instead of ~/.grok
.grok/auth.json
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Generic: generated junk ------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.exe
*.log
*.tmp
*~
.venv/
venv/

# ---- npm wrapper (no dependencies are ever installed, but just in case) ----
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# ---- Generic: built installers -----------------------------------------------
dist/
*.dmg
